        {
            "_id": "KqOz4L732GrEqNJn",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
            "name": "Helm Dependent",
            "sort": 300000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "passive"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Deravon is incorporeal, but the magical helm he wears is physical, perched atop his head as securely as if he were a physical creature. He cannot pass through solid objects while wearing his helm, but without it he is weakened. A PC can remove his helm with a @Check[athletics|dc:27] check to [[/act disarm]], and if Deravon's ghost critically fails a Reflex save, he must immediately attempt a second Reflex save against the same DC. On a failure, his helm topples from his head. While he can move through solid objects while his helm is off, he can't use Aeon Stars or Bow Before Me, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]{Slowed 1} as long as he remains without his helm.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [
                    {
                        "key": "RollOption",
                        "label": "PF2E.NPCAbility.Deravon.HelmetDependent.RollOptionLabel",
                        "option": "item:slug:deravons-helm",
                        "toggleable": true,
                        "value": true
                    },
                    {
                        "key": "Immunity",
                        "predicate": [
                            "item:slug:deravons-helm"
                        ],
                        "type": "spirit"
                    },
                    {
